    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Is method call slow by reflection? Yes, that''s right.

    So, CompositeToggle
    has a feature to bake properties into scripts.

    The baked property will execute
    at the same speed as C# code.


    In addition, the allocation size on instantiation
    is minimized.'
